# Workspaces produced by the tool. "Raw exports/" is an immutable archive of
# instrument exports, "Records/" is regenerated from it, and reports/ is the
# combined per-material export rebuilt from Records/ on every ingest -- none
# of these belongs in version control. (data/ covers all of them when the
# default workspace is used; the individual names cover a workspace pointed
# elsewhere, e.g. this repo checkout itself. raw_input/ and processed_output/
# are the pre-rename names, kept here too since a workspace that already has
# one of those on disk keeps using it -- see Workspace.raw/.processed.)
data/
Raw exports/
Records/
raw_input/
processed_output/
reports/
audit/
knowledge_base.db
materials.json

# Real instrument exports used by the regression pins. Drop them in locally;
# they are not redistributed here.
tests/data/*.xlsx
tests/data/*.xls
